---

## 8. What Lives Where

| Responsibility | Location |
|----------------|----------|
| UI rendering | Turnstile Frontend |
| CORS/proxying | Turnstile Backend |
| Pipeline execution | Orchestrator |
| Service routing | SAK Router |
| Session storage | Session Manager |
| Document retrieval | Artifact Assembler |
| LLM calls | SAK → Model Gateway |

Turnstile backend is just a proxy.
